WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.200
Modulo decomposes millions of portfolio data points into usable signals.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:14.000
AI ranks the changes most likely to reach the revenue goal, informed by elasticity and operating history.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.200
Operators review the logic, guardrails, and expected impact before rates move.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.100
Each outcome becomes new evidence for the next decision.